  "prefLabel": "Lab 1505.04 Financial Statement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1505.04 Financial Statement. Annually, the licensee shall submit to the department an audited financial statement prepared by an independent certified accountant showing the licensee has a minimum working capital of $100,000, or if the licensee does not have that level of working capital then the licensee shall explain how it will deal with any shortfall using the alternatives of RSA 277-B:6, I.\n\nSource. #10221, eff 11-3-12; ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab1500.html"
}
